<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">2 Petro</para>
  <para style="toc1">Petro Nwoma A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Petro</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petro</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nwoma A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Krataa yi firi Simon Petro a meyɛ Yesu Kristo ɔsomfoɔ ne ne ɔsomafoɔ nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 1:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Mede kɔma wɔn a ɛsiane yɛn Onyankopɔn ne yɛn Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo tenenee enti, wɔama wɔn gyidie a ɛsom bo te sɛ yɛn deɛ no ara pɛ no:<verse eid="2PE 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Adom ne asomdwoeɛ a ɛdɔɔso a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn ne Yesu a ɔyɛ yɛn Awurade no mmra mo so.<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Frɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Onyankopɔn nam ne tumi so ama mo biribiara a ɛho hia ma asetena pa ne nyamesu. Nimdeɛ a yɛwɔ wɔ deɛ ɔfiri nʼanimuonyam ne nnepa mu frɛɛ yɛn no na ama yɛn saa tumi yi. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>Ɔnam nʼanimuonyam ne ne nnepa so ahyɛ yɛn bɔ a ɛsom bo yie. Ɛno enti, wama yɛn ne su kronkron no bi, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a yɛbɛfiri ewiase yi porɔeɛ a akɔnnɔ bɔne de ba no mu.<verse eid="2PE 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Esiane saa enti, mommɔ mmɔden mfa nneyɛeɛ a ɛho teɛ nka mo gyidie ho; na momfa nimdeɛ nka nneyɛeɛ a ɛho teɛ ho; <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>na momfa ahohyɛsoɔ nka mo nimdeɛ ho; na momfa boasetɔ nka mo ahohyɛsoɔ ho; na momfa nyamesom pa nka mo boasetɔ ho; <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>na momfa onuadɔ nka nyamesom pa ho, na momfa ɔdɔ amapa nka onuadɔ ho. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Yeinom ne su pa a ɛho hia mo. Na sɛ monya ma ɛdɔɔso a, ɛbɛma mo ayɛ nnam wɔ yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo ho nimdeɛ mu. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Na obiara a ɔnni bi no yɛ onifirani a ɔntumi nhunu adeɛ. Ne werɛ afiri sɛ wɔahohoro ne bɔne dada.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Enti, me nuanom adɔfoɔ, monyere mo ho wɔ dwuma no die mu, na ɛnni mo ho adanseɛ ampa ara sɛ Onyankopɔn afrɛ mo, ayi mo atena hɔ afebɔɔ. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, morensunti na morempa aba nso. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Sɛ mofa saa ɛkwan yi so a, wɔbɛma mo akɔ yɛn Awurade ne yɛn Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo Ahennie a ɛtoɔ ntwa da no mu.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Ne saa enti, daa mekaakae mo saa asɛm yi a monim na atim nokorɛ a moagye adi no mu no. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Mesusu sɛ, ɛyɛ sɛ mmerɛ dodoɔ a mete ase yi, mɛbɔ mo nkaeɛ wɔ saa asɛm yi ho. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Menim sɛ ɛrenkyɛre biara mɛgya saa ɔhonam yi hɔ sɛdeɛ yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo daa no adi kyerɛɛ me no. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Mɛbɔ mmɔden sɛ mɛfa ɛkwan biara so ama mo akae saa nsɛm yi ɛberɛ biara wɔ me wuo akyi.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Ɛnyɛ anansesɛm na yɛte bɛka kyerɛɛ mo wɔ yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo tumi ne ba a ɔrebɛba no ho, na mmom, yɛahunu na yɛdi ne kɛseyɛ no ho adanseɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>Yɛwɔ hɔ bi na Agya Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ no animuonyam ɛberɛ a nne bi firi Animuonyam kɛseɛ mu kaa sɛ, “Yei ne me Dɔba a ɔsɔ mʼani!” no. <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Yɛn ankasa tee nne no sɛ ɛfiri ɔsoro reba ɛberɛ a na yɛne no wɔ Bepɔ Kronkron no so no.<verse eid="2PE 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Ɛno enti, ɛma yɛnya nkɔm a odiyifoɔ no hyɛeɛ no mu gyidie yie. Ɛsɛ sɛ motie no yie ɛfiri sɛ, ɛte sɛ kanea a ɛhyerɛn wɔ sum mu kɔsi da a adeɛ bɛkye ama anɔpa nsoromma ahyerɛn wɔ mo akoma mu no. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Yeinom nyinaa akyi no, monkae saa asɛm yi: Obiara nni hɔ a ɔnam nʼankasa so bɛtumi akyerɛ Atwerɛsɛm mu nkɔmhyɛ ase. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Na nkɔmhyɛ biara mfiri onipa pɛ mu, na mmom, Honhom Kronkron tumi mu na nnipa ka asɛm a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Atorɔ Adiyifoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Atorɔ adiyifoɔ kɔɔ tetefoɔ no mu, na saa ara nso na atorɔ adiyifoɔ bɛba mo mu ara ne no. Wɔbɛkyerɛ nkyerɛkyerɛ bɔne a nokorɛ nni mu na wɔapa Owura a ɔgyee wɔn no, na ɛnam so ama ɔsɛeɛ aba wɔn so prɛko pɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Nnipa bebree bɛfa akwammɔne so na ɛsiane deɛ wɔyɛ no enti, nnipa bɛkasa atia nokorɛ ɛkwan no. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Saa atorɔ adiyifoɔ yi nam wɔn sikanibereɛ so bɛto anansesɛm akyerɛ mo de apɛ mo ho mfasoɔ. Wɔn ɔtemmufoɔ siesiee ne ho akyɛre, na saa ara nso na wɔn ɔsɛefoɔ no nso asɔre agyina.<verse eid="2PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Onyankopɔn amfa abɔfoɔ a wɔyɛɛ bɔne no ho ankyɛre wɔn. Ɔtoo wɔn guu asaman sum mu baabi guu wɔn nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn, na ɛhɔ na wɔretwɛn Atemmuo da no. <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>Onyankopɔn amma tete ewiase no amfa ne ho anni. Ɔmaa nsuyire baa wɔn a wɔannye asɛm no anni no so. Wɔn a ɔgyee wɔn nkwa no ne Noa a ɔkaa tenenee ho asɛm no ne nnipa baason bi. <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>Onyankopɔn buu Sodom ne Gomora fɔ de ogya sɛee wɔn, de bɔɔ wɔn a wɔnnye Onyankopɔn nni no kɔkɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>Ɔgyee Lot a ɔyɛ ɔteneneeni no firii nnipa nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nsam. <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Na saa ɔteneneeni no te saa nnipa nnebɔneyɛfoɔ no mu na afideɛ a na saa nnipa no yɛ no adekyeeɛ ne adesaeɛ no ha no yie. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Yei kyerɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn nim ɛkwan a ɔfa so gye nʼakyidifoɔ firi ɔhaw mu, ɛnna ɔnim ɛkwan a ɔfa so kora nnipa nnebɔneyɛfoɔ, twe wɔn aso de twɛn Atemmuo da no, <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>ne titire no, wɔn a wɔdi wɔn honam akɔnnɔ akyi na wɔpa Onyankopɔn tumi no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Saa atorɔ akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ yi wɔ akokoɔduru na wɔmmu animuonyamfoɔ a wɔwɔ ɔsoro no, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔte wɔn atua. <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Na abɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ ahoɔden ne tumi sene saa atorɔ akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ yi mpo nka nsɛmmɔne mmu wɔn atɛn wɔ Awurade anim. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Nanso, saa nnipa yi yɛ wɔn nneɛma te sɛ mmoa a wonni adwene, wɔwo wɔn sɛ wɔnkye wɔn nku wɔn. Wɔgu nneɛma biara a wɔnte aseɛ no ho fi. Wɔbɛsɛe wɔn sɛ mmoa.<verse eid="2PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>Ɔhaw a wɔma ɛbaeɛ no, wɔbɛtua wɔn so ka. Deɛ wɔn ani gye ho ne sɛ wɔbɛyɛ biribiara awia ketee a ɛbɛyɛ ama wɔn honam akɔnnɔ. Sɛ wɔne mo to nsa didi a, ɛgu wɔn anim ase. Ɛfiri sɛ, saa ɛberɛ no na wɔka nnaadaasɛm. <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Wɔnhwehwɛ hwee sɛ mmaa adwamanfoɔ ɛfiri sɛ, wɔpɛ sɛ daa wɔyɛ bɔne. Wɔdaadaa nnipa a wɔyɛ mmerɛ kɔ bɔne mu. Wɔayɛn wɔn akoma ama anibereɛ. Wɔwɔ Onyankopɔn nnome ase. <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>Wɔamane afiri ɛkwan tee no so enti wɔayera. Wɔafa ɛkwan a Beor ba Bileam a ne sika a ɔnya de yɛ bɔne no kɔfaa so no so. <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>Yei maa wɔkaa nʼanim wɔ ne bɔne no ho. Nʼafunumu de onipa nne kasaeɛ de sii odiyifoɔ no abɔdamsɛm no ho ɛkwan.<verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Saa nnipa yi te sɛ asutire a awe anaasɛ omununkum a mframa bɔ no. Onyankopɔn de wɔn asie esum kabii mu wɔ baabi. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Wɔka ahantansɛm ne nkwaseasɛm na wɔnam wɔn honam akɔnnɔ ho nnaadaa so twetwe wɔn a wɔatwe wɔn ho afiri nnebɔneyɛfoɔ ho. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>Wɔhyɛ wɔn ahofadie ho bɔ wɔ ɛberɛ a wɔn ankasa wɔyɛ bɔne nkoa ɛfiri sɛ, onipa yɛ akoa ma biribiara a ɛdi no so. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Na sɛ onipa sua yɛn Awurade ne yɛn Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo ho asɛm, na ɔnam so dwane firi ewiase yi mu akwammɔne so, na akyire no ɔkɔ bɔne mu bio ma ɔdane bɔne akoa a, ɛnneɛ ɛyɛ hu sene ne kane no. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Sɛ wɔnnim Kristo koraa a, anka ɛyɛ ma wɔn sene sɛ wɔbɛsua ne ho nsɛm na afei wɔbɛdane wɔn akyi akyerɛ mmara Kronkron a wɔde maa wɔn no. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>Deɛ ɛbaa wɔn so no kyerɛ sɛ, saa ɛbɛ yi yɛ nokorɛ. “Ɔkraman sane kɔtafere ne fe ɛnna ɔprako a wɔadware no no nso kɔyantam wɔ atɛkyɛ mu.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Mmaeɛ A Ɔbɛba Bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Adɔfonom, yei ne krataa a ɛtɔ so mmienu a matwerɛ abrɛ mo. Metwerɛɛ sɛ mede rebɛkae mo, de akanyane mo adwene. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>Mepɛ sɛ mokae nsɛm a adiyifoɔ kronkron no kaa mmerɛ bi a atwam no ne mmara a ɛfiri Awurade ne Agyenkwa a wɔde faa mo asomafoɔ so maa mo no.<verse eid="2PE 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Deɛ ɛdi ɛkan no, ɛsɛ sɛ mote aseɛ sɛ nna a ɛdi akyire no mu no, nnipa bi bɛba a wɔn ara wɔn honam akɔnnɔ na ɛbɛdi wɔn so. Wɔbɛdi mo ho fɛ <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>aka sɛ, “Ɔhyɛɛ mo bɔ sɛ ɔbɛba. Wanka? Na ɔwɔ he? Yɛn agyanom awuwu dada, nanso biribiara te sɛ deɛ ɛte firi adebɔ mfitiaseɛ!” <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Wɔhyɛ da ma wɔn werɛ firi nokorɛ no sɛ, ɛfiri tete no, Onyankopɔn kasaeɛ na wɔbɔɔ ɔsoro ne asase. Wɔbɔɔ asase firi nsuo mu na wɔde nsuo na ɛyɛeɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>Akyire no wɔde nsuyire bɛsɛee no. <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Nanso, Onyankopɔn ahyɛ sɛ ɔsoro ne asase ntena hɔ nkɔsi Atemmuo da. Afei wɔbɛsɔ emu ogya na wɔbɛsɛe nnebɔneyɛfoɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Nanso, anuanom, mommma mo werɛ mfiri adeɛ baako sɛ Awurade ani so deɛ, nsonsonoeɛ nni da koro ne mfeɛ apem ntam. Ne fam deɛ, ne mmienu nyinaa yɛ pɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Awurade ntwentwɛn ne nan ase wɔ ne bɔ a wahyɛ ho sɛdeɛ ebinom dwene no. Mmom, ɔwɔ mo ho boasetɔ ɛfiri sɛ, ɔmpɛ sɛ wɔbɛsɛe obiara, na mmom, ɔpɛ sɛ obiara sakra firi ne bɔne ho.<verse eid="2PE 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Na Awurade da no bɛba sɛ owifoɔ. Ɛda no, ɔsoro bɛbobom na ayera na ewiem nneɛma bɛhye na asɛe na asase ne so nneɛma nyinaa nso bɛda adi.<verse eid="2PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Sɛ saa ɛkwan yi so na wɔbɛfa asɛe adeɛ nyinaa a, na ɛdeɛn bra na ɛsɛ sɛ wobɔ? Ɛsɛ sɛ mo bra yɛ kronkron na mode mo ho ma Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>Monhwɛ saa da no kwan na monyɛ mo nneɛma pɛpɛɛpɛ; saa da a Onyankopɔn bɛto ɔsoro mu ogya na ewiem nneɛma anane na ayera wɔ ogyaframa mu no. <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Nanso, yɛtwɛn deɛ Onyankopɔn ahyɛ yɛn ho bɔ no, ɔsoro foforɔ ne asase foforɔ a ɛhɔ na tenenee bɛtena.<verse eid="2PE 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Enti, anuanom, mogu so retwɛn da no yi, mommɔ mmɔden sɛ mobɛyɛ kronn a mfomsoɔ biara nni mo ho wɔ Onyankopɔn anim na mo ne no atena wɔ asomdwoeɛ mu. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Monkae nhunu sɛ Awurade wɔ boasetɔ ɛfiri sɛ ɔpɛ sɛ obiara nya nkwagyeɛ. Ɛno na yɛn nua Paulo nam nyansa a Onyankopɔn de maa no no so twerɛɛ mo no. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Saa ɛkwan korɔ no ara so na ɔfa twerɛɛ ne nkrataa no na saa nsɛm yi ara so nso na ɔgyina twerɛeɛ. Nsɛm bi a ɛyɛ den wɔ ne nkrataa no mu no, wɔn a wɔnnim na wɔnnyɛ den no ntumi nkyerɛ aseɛ yie. Saa ara na wɔyɛ Atwerɛsɛm a aka no de ɔsɛeɛ ba wɔn so.<verse eid="2PE 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Nanso anuanom, mo deɛ monim yei dada. Monwɛn na wɔn a wɔnni mmara so annaadaa mo amfiri beaeɛ pa. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Monyini wɔ yɛn Awurade ne Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo adom ne nimdeɛ mu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 3:18"/>
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 3:18"/>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">Ɔno na animuonyam nka no seesei ne daa. Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
